        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    starting_index_value = 121\n    starting_prices = [15, 20, 30]\n    ending_prices = [20, 30, 25]\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    percentage_changes = [\n        ending / starting - 1\n        for starting, ending in zip(starting_prices, ending_prices)\n    ]\n    equal_weighted_change = sum(percentage_changes) / len(percentage_changes)\n    answer = round(starting_index_value * (1 + equal_weighted_change), 3)\n\n    # return answer\n    return answer\n```",
